  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment Program (GEWEP) III - DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vulnerable women and girls living in North Kivu (of whom 90 000 will be direct participants), benefitting from transformation and gender justice, exercise their socio-economic, civil, and political rights, including in relation to gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
